.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
node_modules/
dist/

.vercel
.claude/

# Graphify's code-knowledge-graph output: ~1.4 MB of generated graph.json +
# graph.html, rebuilt from the tree by `graphify update .` in about 20 seconds.
# Ignored rather than committed so it does not put a megabyte of churn into every
# merge request. If we'd rather the whole team start with a prebuilt map, drop
# this line and run `graphify hook install`, which registers a union merge driver
# for graph.json so two branches' graphs do not conflict.
graphify-out/

# The Insight dashboard's measurements, regenerated from the tree by
# `npm run insight:build` in about a second. backlog.json next to it is the
# opposite — hand-maintained, and committed on purpose.
tools/insight/data.json

# Local secrets. The connector-request form's Zoho endpoint is an unauthenticated
# write URL, so it lives in the environment and never in the repository — which
# has been public on GitHub and stays worth protecting after the GitLab move.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
